+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use Argon2id as the password hashing algorithm. It was chosen because it is memory-hard, which makes GPU-based brute-force attacks more expensive. No cost parameters (memory, iterations, parallelism) have been recorded, so none are specified here.
